  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="562206a7-df82-5374-a4e9-0838ea3d58e3" activityNameId="f036c1a4-dfd6-56db-a4f3-c9cf1817887f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Dried roughage store, non ventilated</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Dried roughage store, non ventilated
The module includes the installations for the dried roughage store (impeller blower with telescopic spreader) and the part of the building around the store (floor, walls and roof). Size: 830 m3. Lifetime of the building is 50 years.;
UUID: 585ea5d0-6ec7-3bd0-a251-f441cbe9d6a3
The inventory takes into account the use of construction materials and building machines for construction, repair and replacement including waste disposal and the transportation of the materials to the building site. Not taken into account were direct emission of the construction, disposal of production waste and the use of resources during utilization phase. 
Location: The inventory applies for Swiss agricultural buildings only, because of the solid method of construction.
Technology: The data of the inventory are based on one example of a typical agricultural building.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: The inventory is calculated based on a solid database of agricultural buildings. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_585ea5d0-6ec7-3bd0-a251-f441cbe9d6a3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
